* MODEL TEMP RANGE IS -40 TO +125 DEG C.
* NOTE THAT MODEL IS FUNCTIONAL OVER THIS
* RANGE BUT NOT ALL PARAMETERS TRACK    
* THOSE OF THE REAL PART.
* NOTE THAT SUPPLY CURRENT IS MODELED FOR ONLY ONE AMPLIFIER 
* AND IS HENCE HALF OF THE TOTAL SUPPLY CONSUMED BY THE LMP7732
*///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
* PINOUT ORDER +IN -IN V+ V- OUT
* PINOUT ORDER  3   4   5  2  1
.SUBCKT LMP7732 3 4 5 2 1
*///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
* USE V10 BELOW TO ADJUST OFFSET
V10 13 25 0.22E-6
*////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
* MODEL FEATURES INCLUDE OUTPUT SWING, OUTPUT CURRENT THRU
* THE SUPPLY RAILS, OUTPUT CURRENT LIMIT, OPEN LOOP GAIN
* AND PHASE WITH RL AND CL EFFECTS, SLEW RATE, COMMON MODE
* REJECTION WITH FREQ EFFECTS, POWER SUPPLY REJECTION WITH
* FREQ EFFECTS, INPUT VOLTAGE NOISE WITH 1/F, INPUT CURRENT
* NOISE WITH 1/F, INPUT BIAS CURRENT, INPUT COMMON MODE
* RANGE, INPUT OFFSET VOLTAGE WITH TEMPERATURE EFFECTS,
* AND QUIESCENT CURRENT VS VOLTAGE AND TEMPERATURE.
* MODEL INCLUDES TRIPLE DIFF INPUT PROTECTION DIODES.
*//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
* MODEL TEMP RANGE IS -40 TO +125 DEG C.
* NOTE THAT MODEL IS FUNCTIONAL OVER THIS RANGE BUT NOT ALL PARAMETERS TRACK
* THOSE OF THE REAL PART.
*///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

